:: X-Change Silver Stranger [widget]
<<widget "silverStrangerInit">>
	<<if $xchange.silverStranger is undefined or typeof $xchange.silverStranger isnot "object" or Array.isArray($xchange.silverStranger)>>
		<<set $xchange.silverStranger to { unlocked: false, met: false }>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "silverStrangerCheck">>
	<<silverStrangerInit>>
	<<set _silverActive to false>>
	/* Lazily unlock once either condition is met, then it stays unlocked. */
	<<if !$xchange.silverStranger.unlocked and
	(($xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.keptEarpiece) or ($xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.earpieceCompromised) or ($xchange_fame gte 1000))>>
		<<set $xchange.silverStranger.unlocked to true>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $xchange.silverStranger.unlocked>>
		<<if $daily.silverStranger is undefined>>
			<<set $daily.silverStranger to (random(1, 100) lte 35)>>
		<</if>>
		/* Separate daily 33% "feeling generous" roll; grants at most one free pill that day. */
		<<if $daily.silverGenerous is undefined>>
			<<set $daily.silverGenerous to (random(1, 100) lte 33)>>
		<</if>>
		<<set _silverActive to $daily.silverStranger>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

/* Park hub link only before the first meeting, and never at night. */
<<widget "silverStrangerPark">>
	<<silverStrangerCheck>>
	<<if _silverActive and !$xchange.silverStranger.met and Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		Off the path, near the tulip beds, <span class="purple">someone seems to loiter</span>.
		<br>
		<<icon "mark.gif">><<link [[Approach the loitering figure (0:05)|Silver Stranger Meet]]>><<set $xchange.silverStranger.met to true>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

/* Docks hub link only after the first meeting. */
<<widget "silverStrangerDocks">>
	<<silverStrangerCheck>>
	<<if _silverActive and $xchange.silverStranger.met is true>>
		Near the edge of the water, a <span class="purple">figure of silver</span> watches the tide, in no hurry to be anywhere.
		<br>
		<<icon "mark.gif">><<link [[Approach the silver figure (0:05)|Silver Stranger]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Silver Stranger Meet
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
You step off the path. As you come closer, the seated figure rises from the bench and greets you.
<<switch $bodysize>>
<<case -1 0>>
	Even at your <<if $bodysize is -1>>miniature<<else>>tiny<</if>> height, they end up only a little taller than you.
<<case 1>>
	At your small stature, the two of you come to stand almost eye to eye.
<<case 2 2.5>>
	From your <<if $bodysize is 2.5>>tall<<else>>average<</if>> height you find you look down at them a touch;
	up close they are shorter than they first seemed.
<<default>>
	From your <<if $bodysize gte 4>>giant<<else>>large<</if>> frame you simply loom over them.
	They are so small beside you<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	that some part of you decides they look about bite-sized<</if>>.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
"There you are," they say, and, the greeting made, settle back onto the bench and gesture for you to sit. "I've been meaning to have a proper look at you."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Silver Stranger Meet 1]]>><</link>>

:: Silver Stranger Meet 1
<<effects>>
Everything about them is silver. Their hair falls past their shoulders like poured metal, and their skin is pale.
Their eyes are the strangest part: a bright silver that throws your own reflection back at you,
so you can never quite read what they're thinking.
<br><br>
<<if $wraithIntro>>
	You've seen skin that pale before, down in the deep water where that ghost waits.
	But the ghost looked even paler, like it had no life left in it at all. But this person looks very much alive.
	<br><br>
	"Not like your drowned friend, am I?" they say, before you can find the words for it.
	The corner of their mouth lifts. "Disappointing?"
	<br><br>
	You frown. But there's something about this person you can't quite place... the set of their shoulders,
	the line of their jaw. You look, and look again, and still can't decide whether you're looking at a man or a woman.
	After a while you stop trying. <i>They</i>, then.
<<else>>
	There's something about them you can't quite place... the set of their shoulders, the line of their jaw.
	You look, and look again, and still can't decide whether you're looking at a man or a woman.
	After a while you stop trying. <i>They</i>, then.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.keptEarpiece>>
	"I know you kept something, an important earpiece that connects you to someone. Am I right?" They tilt their head.
	"That's exactly the sort of loose end I'm usually sent to tidy away."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Silver Stranger Meet 2]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"You've made quite a name for yourself, and I listen.
	A name like yours was always going to reach me sooner or later anyway." They smile.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Silver Stranger Meet 3]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Silver Stranger Meet 2
<<effects>>
"Mickey," they say.
<br><br>
You freeze. Your hand twitches toward the place you keep the earpiece hidden, your fingers clenching into a fist.
It's a struggle <span class="red">to crush it</span>... or the person in front of you. "Don't say that name."
<br><br>
"The one behind the locked door," they continue, as if you hadn't spoken.
<br><br>
You take a step forward before you can stop yourself. "How do you know about them?"
<br><br>
The Stranger gives a shrug. "I make a habit of knowing things people would rather keep buried."
<br><br>
"That doesn't answer me."
<br><br>
"Yes," they say. "It doesn't. Anyway, I deal in loose ends, and Mickey has been one for a while now.
Every sensible instinct tells me to get rid of them."
<br><br>
"If you touch them—"
<br><br>
They lift one pale hand, stopping you before the threat can finish.
"Relax. I won't." Their voice stays calm, almost bored. "To get rid of Mickey, I'd first have to call them a threat,
and they simply aren't one. I dislike giving people that much credit."
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask what they actually want|Silver Stranger Meet 3]]>><</link>>

:: Silver Stranger Meet 3
<<effects>>
You force yourself to keep looking at them without looking away. "Stop circling around it. What do you want from me?"
<br><br>
"To watch, mainly. You're a rare sort of thing, and I do enjoy a rare thing."
They take a small capsule out from a hidden fold in their coat.
"<span class="green">And to trade</span>. Whatever pill you care to name, I can put it in your hand.
Pink, blue, purple, colourless. The premium stock people keep locked away. The green ones that undo the rest.
Even the cheap, unlabelled one the dealers push on street corners."
<br><br>
They put the capsule away, tucking it back into their coat.
<br><br>
"I'm not meeting you again here. It's too bright, and too many people could see us."
They glance away. "There's a better place for me. You won't find it on any map, but once you know the water,
it's easy to reach town from there. Hmmm. <span class="gold">Maybe meet me at the docks instead</span>?
That's the easiest way across."
<br><br>
They look at you a little longer, now clearly interested.
"Maybe I'll ask you for a favor someday... you're someone I want to remember."
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Silver Stranger
<<effects>>
The silver figure is waiting by the water, just like they said. When you arrive, they give you a small nod.
<<if $daily.silverGenerous and !$daily.silverGaveFree>>
	"There you are. I'm feeling generous today. What do you need?"
<<else>>
	"Back again? Well then... what do you need?"
<</if>>
<br><br>
/* $xchange.silverStranger.asked counts how many questions have been asked (0-4).
   They come one at a time, in order: 1 Mickey, 2 Self, 3 Interest, 4 Route. */
<<if $xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.landryReported>>
	<<set _asked to ($xchange.silverStranger.asked || 0)>>
	<<if _asked lt 1>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about Mickey|Silver Stranger Mickey]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif _asked is 1>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about them|Silver Stranger Self]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif _asked is 2>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask why they take an interest in you|Silver Stranger Interest]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif _asked is 3>>
		<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask what they know about your involvement|Silver Stranger Route]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<pillicon>><<link [[Look at their wares|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "menu">><</link>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Mickey
<<effects>>
<<set $xchange.silverStranger.asked to 1>>
You ask whether they've thought any more about Mickey.
<br><br>
"Nothing's changed, I'm afraid. Mickey stays as they are, for as long as they can manage it."
A dry note enters their voice. "If anything, I'd miss the trouble they cause."
<br><br>
<<if $xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.keptEarpiece>>
	"You could still break that earpiece, you know. Cut the last connection yourself."
	They shrug, one shoulder. "Or keep it. I rather like knowing it's still out there."
	<br><br>
	Hearing that, you feel it would be better to destroy it. <span class="red">You take out the earpiece and crush it</span>
	in your hand. The silver figure watches it break, looking quietly amused.
	<br><br>
	<<unset $xchange.bankHeist.keptEarpiece>><<unset $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece>>
<<elseif $xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.earpieceCompromised>>
	"I took something interesting from that little earpiece, you know." Their mouth curves slightly.
	"<span class="red">Maybe that's what led me to you in the first place</span>. Amusing, isn't it?"
	<br><br>
	<<unset $xchange.bankHeist.earpieceCompromised>><<unset $xchange.bankHeist.hasEarpiece>>
<</if>>
<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask something else|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Self
<<effects>>
<<set $xchange.silverStranger.asked to 2>>
You ask their name.
<br><br>
"Hmm...?" They tilt their head until their long silver hair spills over one shoulder.
"I don't give out names. Call me nothing."
<br><br>
You ask what they are, then, and where the place across the water actually is.
<br><br>
"Closer than you think. You may have seen others like me before. Did you notice?"
They look at you for a moment.
"You'll find that place one day. Just not yet. The town still has use for you, and so do I."
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask something else|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Interest
<<effects>>
<<set $xchange.silverStranger.asked to 3>>
You ask why they bother with you at all.
<br><br>
"Because you're not like most people. Most people are easy to understand. You aren't.
You change when you need to, and that makes you useful." They watch you closely.
<<if $xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.heistComplete>>
	"And after what happened at the bank, I know you're capable. Not many could do that."
	<br><br>
	"You know about the bank?" you ask.
	<br><br>
	"Why wouldn't I?" They smirk.
<</if>>
"There's something I may need help with later. I wouldn't trust it to just anyone. But I think you might be able to handle it."
<br><br>
<<link [[Hold your tongue and let them talk|Silver Stranger Interest End]]>><<set $phase to "listen">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask more about it|Silver Stranger Interest End]]>><<set $phase to "ask">><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Interest End
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is "ask">>
	"What is it?" you ask.
	<br><br>
	They look amused for a moment. "About time you ask <i>'what'</i>, after all the questions you've been throwing at me.
	But no, why should I answer you?"
<<else>>
	You stay quiet and let them speak.
	<br><br>
	That seems to please them. "Hmm? You didn't push. Patience will help you with what comes next."
	<<set $xchange.elkkarma to ($xchange.elkkarma || 0) + 1>>| <span class="elk">+ ???</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Whatever they mean, they clearly aren't going to explain it now.
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask something else|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Route
<<effects>>
<<set $xchange.silverStranger.asked to 4>>
You ask what they know about your involvement.
<br><br>
"Enough to know where it started."
<<if $xchange.bankHeist.route is "gala">>
	They give you a sly smile. "It started with a gala, did it? With all chandeliers, old names,
	and people pretending they aren't watching each other from across the room."
	<br><br>
	"Be honest with me," they say, holding your gaze.
	"Do you really like this world? The galas, the aristocrats, the little smiles that mean three different things at once?"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Say you rather enjoy them|Silver Stranger Route Gala]]>><<set $phase to "yes">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Say you can't stand them|Silver Stranger Route Gala]]>><<set $phase to "no">><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $xchange.bankHeist.route is "premium">>
	They let out a thoughtful hum. "You were brought in through the private sector. Special orders, special clients...
	special tests. Yes, that tracks."
	<br><br>
	"I always thought there was something unusual about you." They tilt their head, scanning you up and down.
	"Or maybe <i>supernatural</i> is a better word?"
	<br><br>
	You can't even begin to formulate an answer, but from the look on their face, they don't need one.
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask something else|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	They smile, clearly entertained. "Blackmail. Crude, but effective.
	Find the right secret, press in the right place... and people become so very cooperative."
	<br><br>
	"I wonder if you liked it. Not the danger, perhaps, but the control.
	Knowing someone had to move simply because you told them to." They tilt their head, studying you like a fascinating puzzle.
	"Maybe that's where this is heading. One day, you stop being the person people use,
	and become the one using others instead. Maybe you'll even control the people who controlled you before."
	<br><br>
	They laugh softly. "Now <i>that</i> would be worth watching."
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask something else|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Silver Stranger Route Gala
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is "yes">>
You nod, admitting that you actually enjoy the thrill of it all. 
<br><br>
	Their smile fades a little. "Of course you do. While I can't stand them myself.
	So many beautiful rooms, and not one honest word spoken in any of them.
	To survive an evening like that, you have to be the best liar in the room. You'll do well, then.
	Or you'll be eaten alive. At those parties, it can be terribly hard to tell the difference."
<<else>>
	You shake your head. "Not in the slightest."
	<br><br>
	They chuckle. "Neither can I. Everyone smiling, everyone lying, everyone pretending it isn't obvious.
	But I still go." They glance toward the water. "That's how these things work.
	Sometimes you attend because saying no would cause more trouble."
	<br><br>
	They look back at you. "You'll understand that eventually."
	<<set $xchange.elkkarma to ($xchange.elkkarma || 0) + 1>>| <span class="elk">+ ???</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask something else|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Shop
<<effects>>
<<if ($daily.silverBought or 0) gte 3>>
	The silver figure closes their hand before you can look properly. <span class="purple">"That's enough for today. Come back tomorrow."</span>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
They open their hand, revealing several small cases lined up across their palm that far too many for one hand to hold.
"<span class="teal">I carry what the town sells, and a few things it doesn't</span>. It costs more through me, but I don't run out, and I don't ask what you need it for."
<br><br>
<<if $silverShopView is "menu">>
	<<pillicon "xchangeGray">><<link [[Gray X-Change|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "gray">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "xchangePink">><<link [[Pink X-Change|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "pink">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "xchangeBlue">><<link [[Blue X-Change|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "blue">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "xchangePurple">><<link [[Purple X-Change|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "purple">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "pillcure">><<link [[Antidotes & Tests|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "support">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "premium">><<link [[Premium & Clones|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "premium">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<pillicon "pill">><<link [[Suspicious pills|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "suspicious">><</link>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[« Back to categories|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><<set $silverShopView to "menu">><</link>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $silverShopView is "gray">>
		<span class="gold">Gray X-Change</span>
		<br>
		/* Gray priced at £7,600 (base 475000 * 1.6 markup) — above Landry's pub price of £6,000, but not too steep. */
		<<silverStockByPrefix "xchange_gray_" "xchangeGray" 475000>>
	<<elseif $silverShopView is "pink">>
		<span class="gold">Pink X-Change</span>
		<br>
		<<silverStockByPrefix "xchange_pink_" "xchangePink">>
		<<silverStockLine "xchange_sissy" "xchangePink">>
	<<elseif $silverShopView is "blue">>
		<span class="gold">Blue X-Change</span>
		<br>
		<<silverStockByPrefix "xchange_blue_" "xchangeBlue">>
		<<silverStockLine "xchange_butch" "xchangeBlue">>
	<<elseif $silverShopView is "purple">>
		<span class="gold">Purple X-Change</span>
		<br>
		<<silverStockByPrefix "xchange_purple_" "xchangePurple">>
	<<elseif $silverShopView is "support">>
		<span class="gold">Antidotes</span>
		<br>
		<<silverStockLine "xchange_antidote" "pillcure">>
		<<silverStockLine "xchange_antidote_forte" "pillcure">>
		<<set _silverAnti to []>>
		<<run (function () {
			(setup.pills || []).forEach(function (p) {
				if (!p || p.type !== "xchange" || p.subtype !== "anti-pill") return;
				if (typeof p.name !== "string") return;
				var m = p.name.match(/^SWP Anti-(.+) Pill$/);
				if (!m) return;
				if (m[1] === "portal" && !State.variables.portalPantiesEnabled) return;
				State.temporary.silverAnti.pushUnique(m[1]);
			});
		})()>>
		<<if _silverAnti.length gt 0>>
			<<for _t range _silverAnti>>
				<<set _antiName to "SWP Anti-" + _t + " Pill">>
				<<silverStockRaw _antiName 500000 "pillcure">>
			<</for>>
		<<else>>
			They spread their empty hand. "Nothing green today. Even I run out sometimes."
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $silverShopView is "premium">>
		<span class="gold">Premium &amp; Clones</span>
		<br>
		<<silverStockRaw "X-Change Premium" 1000000 "premium">>
		<<silverStockByPrefix "xchange_clone_" "premium">>
	<<elseif $silverShopView is "suspicious">>
		<span class="gold">Suspicious pills</span>
		<br>
		<<silverStockRaw "Suspicious Pink Pill" 2000 "pill">>
		<<silverStockRaw "Suspicious Blue Pill" 2000 "pill">>
		<<silverStockRaw "Suspicious Purple Pill" 2000 "pill">>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Step back|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Silver Stranger Buy
<<effects>>
<<if $silverLastFree>>
	You reach for your money, but they gently push your hand away, pressing the small case into your palm instead.
	"No charge. Remember? I'm feeling generous now."
	<br><br>
	<span class="green">They gave it to you for free.</span>
<<else>>
	They pocket your payment without bothering to count it, handing over the small case in return. Through the glass, the pill catches the light like frost.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $silverLastFree to false>>
<<pillicon>><<link [[Look at their wares again|Silver Stranger Shop]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Step back|Silver Stranger]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: X-Change Silver Stranger Shop [widget]
/* Renders one purchasable line for a pill whose inventory name and pre-markup base price are known directly.
_args: 0 pill name, 1 base price, 2 pill icon. */
<<widget "silverStockRaw">>
	<<set _srName to _args[0]>>
	<<set _srBase to Math.round((_args[1] || 0) * 1.6)>>
	<<set _srCost to -_srBase>>
	<<set _srIcon to _args[2] or "pill">>
	<<set _srLabel to "Buy " + _srName + " (" + formatMoney(setup.inflation.spendPrice(_srBase, "blackMarket")) + ")">>
	<<pillicon _srIcon>>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(_srBase, "blackMarket")>>
		<<capture _srName _srCost _srLabel>><<link _srLabel "Silver Stranger Buy">>
			<<if $sexStats.pills.pills[_srName] is undefined>><<set $sexStats.pills.pills[_srName] to { owned: 0 }>><</if>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.pills[_srName].owned += 1>>
			<<set $sexStats.pills.boughtOnce to true>>
			<<silverStrangerCharge _srCost>>
		<</link>><</capture>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="grey"><<= _srName>> (<<= formatMoney(setup.inflation.spendPrice(_srBase, "blackMarket"))>>)</span> <span class="purple">You can't afford this.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

/* Renders one purchasable line from a setup.pharmacyItems key. _args: 0 key, 1 icon, 2 optional pre-markup base price override. */
<<widget "silverStockLine">>
	<<set _slKey to _args[0]>>
	<<set _slItem to setup.pharmacyItems[_slKey]>>
	<<if _slItem>>
		<<if _slKey.includes("portal") and !$portalPantiesEnabled>>
			/* portal line hidden unless the portal-panties system is enabled */
		<<else>>
			<<set _slPrice to (_args[2] isnot undefined ? _args[2] : _slItem.price)>>
			<<silverStockRaw _slItem.name _slPrice _args[1]>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

/* Renders every setup.pharmacyItems entry whose key starts with a prefix. _args: 0 prefix, 1 icon, 2 optional base price override for the whole category. */
<<widget "silverStockByPrefix">>
	<<set _spref to _args[0]>>
	<<set _spicon to _args[1]>>
	<<set _spprice to _args[2]>>
	<<set _spkeys to []>>
	<<run (function () {
		Object.keys(setup.pharmacyItems || {}).forEach(function (k) {
			if (k.indexOf(State.temporary.spref) === 0) State.temporary.spkeys.push(k);
		});
	})()>>
	<<for _spk range _spkeys>>
		<<silverStockLine _spk _spicon _spprice>>
	<</for>>
<</widget>>

:: X-Change Silver Stranger Charge [widget]
/* Applies the cost of a Silver Stranger pill.
If the stranger is "feeling generous" today (daily 33% roll) and the weekly freebie cap of 4 hasn't been reached,
the pill is free and can be any pill the player buys.
Otherwise it's charged at the marked-up, inflation-adjusted price.

 * _args[0] is the (negative) money delta.
 * Sets $silverLastFree for the Buy passage. */
<<widget "silverStrangerCharge">>
	<<if $daily.silverGenerous is undefined>>
		<<set $daily.silverGenerous to (random(1, 100) lte 33)>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $weekly.silverFreebies is undefined>><<set $weekly.silverFreebies to 0>><</if>>
	/* Free only if generous today, they haven't already given one today, and under the weekly cap. */
	<<if $daily.silverGenerous and !$daily.silverGaveFree and $weekly.silverFreebies lte 4>>
		<<set $silverLastFree to true>>
		<<set $daily.silverGaveFree to true>>
		<<set $weekly.silverFreebies += 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $silverLastFree to false>>
		<<money _args[0] "blackMarket">>
	<</if>>
	/* Daily purchase cap: at most 3 pills a day (free or paid both count). Resets with $daily. */
	<<set $daily.silverBought to ($daily.silverBought or 0) + 1>>
<</widget>>
